      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: Just tested it out in Midnight Rooftop again on the current Live build (1375) and can confirm that this is still an issue.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Go to Midnight Rooftop (wrld_d29bb0d0-d268-42dc-8365-926f9d485505)\n\n2. Walk ~5m into the spawn room\n\n3. Open your Camera\n\n4. In the `Mask` options, turn of Environment\n\n5. Take a picture\n\nOnce you have turned off the environment, you will notice that the image on the camera looks really weird. You will notice the same once you took the picture and are looking at in in Windows.\n\n# Attachments:",
