  "details": "# Issue:\nTurning of the Environment in the Camera will also make the whole image (even your own Avatar) transparent in some worlds. It will also add a transparent layer on top of the whole image.\nI could imagine Fog maybe causing but I can't 100% confirm this.\nThe world I had issues in was Midnight Rooftop (wrld_d29bb0d0-d268-42dc-8365-926f9d485505)\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see the whole image being transparent:",
